 Yurena — as never seen before.","tagline":"The story of a star who didn’t change."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Con el cambio de siglo un cometa atravesó el cielo de España desmontando las leyes de la fama y el éxito, desintegrando la frontera entre lo popular y lo underground. Durante un par de años las portadas y las horas de prime time fueron conquistadas por famosos de otra dimensión. Criaturas que hasta entonces parecían condenadas a la burla y el desprecio y que acapararon nuestra atención sin adaptarse a ninguna normalidad. Un relato mágico donde caben conspiraciones esotéricas, noches eternas, ladrillos cuánticos, supervillanos multicolores y una improbabilidad hecha estrella: Tamara.","tagline":"La historia de una estrella que no cambió"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3AzjTDYfFVmzIS33d0VlHqtaOny.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3AzjTDYfFVmzIS33d0VlHqtaOny.png","language":"es","width":1179,"height":378},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uAZGkupHJk5r6sSNVTZ0axf3dBn.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uAZGkupHJk5r6sSNVTZ0axf3dBn.png","language":"es","width":1289,"height":428}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qXHw7dpCTipuqos2OpPVO35RvQm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qXHw7dpCTipuqos2OpPVO35RvQm.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1OJsdTo8iXGsH9JPKt17ikDD9wt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1OJsdTo8iXGsH9JPKt17ikDD9wt.jpg","language":"es","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/15fj16hKvSwllnQaG1S7OxbBaNq.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/15fj16hKvSwllnQaG1S7OxbBaNq.jpg","language":"es","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aZC1Z3OnknhYRMMCR8N1XwFVElG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t